WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.655 --> 00:00:15.781
"Oh no," Zann thought.

2
00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:19.884
"Maybe we should have kept trying to get home instead of coming back here."

3
00:00:19.904 --> 00:00:22.306
"This is really bad news!"

4
00:00:22.666 --> 00:00:23.546
Perda exclaimed.

5
00:00:24.227 --> 00:00:27.789
The teenage boys had wandered off, but a man and woman walked by.

6
00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:29.911
Perda tapped the man on the arm.

7
00:00:29.931 --> 00:00:31.072
"Excuse me.

8
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.142
Did you see Vilkor and Mellis leave just now?"

9
00:00:34.162 --> 00:00:41.028
"Mellis?" The man sounded distracted as he stared at Zing, who was puffing smoke at a beetle.

10
00:00:41.048 --> 00:00:44.611
"Do you mean that girl who was with King Vilkor?"

11
00:00:44.631 --> 00:00:47.713
"Yes, that's her," the woman said.

12
00:00:48.274 --> 00:00:49.394
She smiled at the kids.

13
00:00:49.414 --> 00:00:53.238
"King Vilkor and Princess Mellis left a few moments ago."

14
00:00:53.258 --> 00:00:56.820
"Did Mellis fight back when her uncle dragged her away with him?"

15
00:00:57.201 --> 00:00:57.921
Zann asked.

16
00:00:58.622 --> 00:01:01.024
The man and woman traded a surprised look.

17
00:01:01.648 --> 00:01:04.050
"No, of course not," the woman said.

18
00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.933
"They're both eager to spread magical peace and prosperity throughout Terrica."

19
00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:10.914
The pair walked away.

20
00:01:12.415 --> 00:01:17.599
Zann thought back to how Mellis had screamed right before he and Perda zapped away earlier.

21
00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:19.961
"Do you think the man and woman are right?"

22
00:01:20.341 --> 00:01:21.201
he asked Perda.

23
00:01:21.802 --> 00:01:26.265
"Maybe Mellis guessed we were leaving Terrica and decided to join forces with Vilkor and the rest of

24
00:01:26.305 --> 00:01:27.666
the inner circle for real."

25
00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:29.047
"No way."

26
00:01:29.427 --> 00:01:30.528
Perda sounded certain.

27
00:01:31.228 --> 00:01:36.112
"She probably wanted to get away from Zira, so she could talk some sense into Vilkor.

28
00:01:36.673 --> 00:01:37.673
We have to find her.

29
00:01:38.174 --> 00:01:40.175
Maybe we can try a Uniting spell."

30
00:01:41.656 --> 00:01:43.118
Zann still felt troubled.

31
00:01:43.138 --> 00:01:46.761
"A Uniting spell only works if the person wants to be found.

32
00:01:47.521 --> 00:01:50.684
If Mellis is mad at us for leaving her behind, it won't work."

33
00:01:51.524 --> 00:01:52.605
Perda rolled her eyes.

34
00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:54.327
"Don't be silly.

35
00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:56.608
Of course she isn't—hey, look!

36
00:01:56.909 --> 00:01:57.769
There's Anso!"

37
00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.812
She rushed toward a boy who was standing nearby.

38
00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.182
Zann followed her, and she introduced the two of them.

39
00:02:04.763 --> 00:02:05.483
"What's going on?"

40
00:02:05.804 --> 00:02:06.925
Perda asked Anso.

41
00:02:06.945 --> 00:02:09.146
"We heard Mellis left with Vilkor."

42
00:02:10.327 --> 00:02:11.388
Anso looked around.

43
00:02:11.408 --> 00:02:14.911
"We shouldn't talk about this in public," he whispered.

44
00:02:15.532 --> 00:02:18.935
He led them to a hidden spot behind a large, flowering shrub.

45
00:02:18.955 --> 00:02:21.677
"Okay, tell us what happened," Zann said.

46
00:02:21.697 --> 00:02:28.983
"After you two left, Mellis convinced Zira and the others that she was on their side now, since

47
00:02:29.023 --> 00:02:30.164
you'd left her behind."

48
00:02:30.972 --> 00:02:32.993
Anso looked nervously over his shoulder.

49
00:02:33.013 --> 00:02:37.154
"They believed her, but she found me and told me the truth."

50
00:02:38.174 --> 00:02:38.954
"What's the truth?"

51
00:02:39.294 --> 00:02:39.915
Perda asked.

52
00:02:39.935 --> 00:02:46.016
"She overheard Zira, Vilkor, and Krub talking after you left," Anso said.

53
00:02:46.036 --> 00:02:51.818
"They were happy because they thought you two had escaped to your own world and would never come

54
00:02:51.898 --> 00:02:55.219
back." "We did try to go home," Zann said.

55
00:02:55.239 --> 00:02:57.959
"We were planning to get help, though, and then come back."

56
00:02:59.020 --> 00:02:59.720
Perda nodded.

57
00:03:00.396 --> 00:03:05.017
"We wanted to come back and help because we suspected that Zira was up to no good."

58
00:03:05.037 --> 00:03:07.318
"You were right."

59
00:03:07.818 --> 00:03:10.899
Anso stopped talking and peeked out around the shrub.

60
00:03:10.919 --> 00:03:14.300
"Uh-oh, Krub is out there," he whispered.

61
00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.961
"Let's get out of here before he sees us."

62
00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:19.101
He dashed out of their hiding place.

63
00:03:19.721 --> 00:03:24.443
Zann and Perda followed him away from the village green, with Zing flying alongside them.

64
00:03:25.363 --> 00:03:29.164
Finally Anso darted into a narrow alley between two houses.

65
00:03:29.888 --> 00:03:33.229
Laundry flapped over the entryway, hiding the kids from the street.

66
00:03:33.249 --> 00:03:39.952
"We should be okay here, at least for now," he said, breathing hard after the run.

67
00:03:39.972 --> 00:03:49.095
"Anyway, as I was saying, Mellis overheard Zira, Vilkor, and Krub plotting to take over all of Terrica

68
00:03:49.135 --> 00:03:51.836
by using their secret knowledge of friction.

69
00:03:52.656 --> 00:03:58.358
Zira is planning to use those purple berries in her courtyard to create a potion that will make

70
00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:00.198
her magic even stronger."

71
00:04:00.218 --> 00:04:01.739
"I knew it!"

72
00:04:02.199 --> 00:04:02.719
Perda said.

73
00:04:02.739 --> 00:04:06.000
"We found out those berries came from another world."

74
00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.541
"Really? Wow."

75
00:04:09.001 --> 00:04:10.161
Anso looked impressed.

76
00:04:10.181 --> 00:04:13.122
"But wait," he added, sounding worried.

77
00:04:13.702 --> 00:04:14.642
"That's not all."

78
00:04:15.383 --> 00:04:18.123
Zann grabbed Zing, who was sniffing at the laundry.

79
00:04:18.543 --> 00:04:22.769
Then he looked back at Anso, concerned by the other boy's worried tone.

80
00:04:22.789 --> 00:04:23.790
"What happened?"

81
00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:24.590
he asked.

82
00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:29.913
"Mellis knew that her uncle and the others were planning something bad," Anso said.

83
00:04:29.933 --> 00:04:35.256
"She wanted to stop them, so she started teaching people how to use friction."

84
00:04:36.397 --> 00:04:39.278
Zann glanced at Perda, who appeared surprised too.

85
00:04:39.298 --> 00:04:42.420
"Mellis didn't want to do that earlier," Zann said.

86
00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:43.681
Perda nodded.

87
00:04:43.701 --> 00:04:47.083
"She must have decided it's worth the risk now."

88
00:04:47.823 --> 00:04:49.084
Anso looked miserable.

89
00:04:49.888 --> 00:04:51.790
"She was right to be afraid.

90
00:04:52.831 --> 00:04:57.074
Zira caught her showing some servants how to use magic to do their work.

91
00:04:57.855 --> 00:05:01.798
So Zira used magic to stop Mellis from talking to them."

92
00:05:02.539 --> 00:05:03.179
"What do you mean?"

93
00:05:03.519 --> 00:05:04.180
Zann asked.

94
00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.842
"Did she zap her away from the servants or something?"

95
00:05:06.862 --> 00:05:12.627
"No, she used some kind of spell to silence her," Anso said.

96
00:05:12.647 --> 00:05:15.449
"Mellis can't speak at all now!

97
00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:22.434
The only reason I know what happened is because she wrote it down and convinced a servant to

98
00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:23.255
bring it to me."

99
00:05:23.875 --> 00:05:24.616
He shook his head.

100
00:05:24.636 --> 00:05:27.798
"I don't know what she wants me to do about it though.

101
00:05:28.458 --> 00:05:29.599
I'm just one kid!

102
00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:34.703
How can anyone fight back against someone as powerful as Zira?"

103
00:05:34.723 --> 00:05:36.804
"Hold on," Perda said.

104
00:05:36.824 --> 00:05:39.806
"Zira knows that Mellis was working against her.

105
00:05:40.647 --> 00:05:44.489
Why did she let her go off with Vilkor instead of punishing her?

106
00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.851
That doesn't seem like her style."

107
00:05:47.651 --> 00:05:52.958
Zann shuddered, remembering how Zira had punished Trof by trapping him with some gorzogs.

108
00:05:53.759 --> 00:05:54.699
Anso shrugged.

109
00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:59.262
"Zira and Krub were ready to dump Mellis in a deep dungeon somewhere.

110
00:05:59.902 --> 00:06:03.544
But Vilkor wanted to take her along, so they let him.

111
00:06:04.264 --> 00:06:10.688
They're still pretending he's in charge, even though pretty much everyone else knows it's really Zira who's running

112
00:06:10.748 --> 00:06:18.172
things." "Zira probably wants to keep Vilkor happy until she grows more berries," Perda said grimly.

113
00:06:18.976 --> 00:06:23.339
"And Mellis can't speak, so Zira probably isn't worried about her."

114
00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:30.245
Zann clenched his fists, suddenly glad that he and Perda hadn't found their way back to Magica after

115
00:06:30.385 --> 00:06:33.427
all. "We have to find Mellis and rescue her!"
